  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven: 87 * 2 * 80 * 4 * 150 * 4\n\nAccording to the question, after replacing the signs:\n\nOption 1) ×− ÷ + = \n\n87 * 2 * 80 * 4 * 150 * 4 ⇒ 87 × 2 - 80 ÷ 4 + 150 = 4\n\n⇒ 87 × 2 - __**80 **____**÷**____** 4**__ + 150 = 4\n\n⇒ __**87 ×**____** 2**__ - 20 + 150 = 4\n\n⇒ __**174 + 150**__ - 20 = 4\n\n⇒ __324____** - 20**__ = 4\n\n⇒ 304 ≠ 4 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2) ×− = + ÷\n\n87 * 2 * 80 * 4 * 150 * 4 ⇒ 87 × 2 - 80 = 4 + 150 ÷ 4\n\n⇒ __**87 ×**____** 2**__ - 80 = 4 + __**150 **____**÷ 4**__\n\n⇒ __**174**____** - 80**__ = __**4 + 37.5**__\n\n⇒ 94 ≠ 41.5 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3) ÷ ×− = +\n\n87 * 2 * 80 * 4 * 150 * 4 ⇒ 87 ÷ 2 × 80 - 4 = 150 + 4\n\n⇒ __**87 ÷**____** 2**__ × 80 - 4 = __**150 + 4**__\n\n⇒ __**43.5**____** ×**____** 80**__ - 4 = 154\n\n⇒ __**34**____80** - 4**__ = 154\n\n⇒ 3476 ≠ 154 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4) ×− ÷ = +\n\n87 * 2 * 80 * 4 * 150 * 4 ⇒ 87 × 2 - 80 ÷ 4 = 150 + 4\n\n⇒ 87 × 2 - __**80 **____**÷**____** 4**__ = __**150 + 4**__\n\n⇒ __**87 ×**____** 2**__ - 20 = 154\n\n⇒ **__174__**__ - 20__ = 154\n\n⇒ **154** **=** **154** **(LHS = RHS)**\n\nHence, \"Option 4\" is the correct answer.",
